# Git commits — no Cursor co-author trailer

When creating commits (via terminal, scripts, or instructions to the user), **never** append or suggest:

- `Co-authored-by: ... cursoragent@cursor.com`
- Any `Co-authored-by` line attributing **Cursor** / **Cursor Agent** / **default avatarCursor**

Human authors only; no IDE/agent attribution in commit messages.
